	"Let's get back to tattooing ya." <<He>> hesitates before adding, "Call me ol' <<tattooed_inmate 0>>. Not around the others though, mind you." <<He>> gives you a stern look. You nod, and <<he>> smiles. "Good. Now let's get back to prettying you up." 
